    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Linux implements this with rt_mutex and PI futexes; POSIX exposes PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT.",
      "narration": "Linux implements it with rt_mutex and priority-inheritance futexes. In user space you request it with the PTHREAD_PRIO_INHERIT protocol.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Priority inheritance in Linux",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
