    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Alternatives: priority ceiling, short critical sections, and never sharing locks across priorities.",
      "narration": "Alternatives include priority ceilings, keeping critical sections tiny, and avoiding locks shared between real-time and background work. Pathfinder was fixed by enabling inheritance.",
